1
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:25,620
YAMU! YAMU!

2
00:00:25,880 --> 00:00:28,437
YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!

3
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:29,560
YAMU!

4
00:00:30,360 --> 00:00:31,480
You're on the move!

5
00:01:03,860 --> 00:01:05,154
What's in there, Yook?

6
00:01:19,200 --> 00:01:22,317
This is the biggest Chinese
restaurant I've ever seen!

7
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:23,753
And get a load of that!

8
00:01:28,260 --> 00:01:30,520
We're just in time for lunch.

9
00:01:31,220 --> 00:01:33,360
And talk about all you can eat.

10
00:01:33,700 --> 00:01:35,600
Sounds like a challenge to me.

11
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:41,860
Easy, cowboys.

12
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:44,780
I didn't see you two on the guest list.

13
00:01:47,900 --> 00:01:49,060
It's Vivian.

14
00:01:49,360 --> 00:01:50,301
She let us here?

15
00:01:50,520 --> 00:01:51,540
But why?

16
00:01:51,900 --> 00:01:52,897
Because she's nuts.

17
00:01:52,980 --> 00:01:54,500
As if you couldn't tell?

18
00:01:55,480 --> 00:01:59,140
Hey, come down here and tell
us what's going on. Fine!

19
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:04,960
Oh, no! She's falling!

20
00:02:08,160 --> 00:02:09,420
Really slowly.

21
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:12,460
Look, guys!

22
00:02:12,720 --> 00:02:14,426
Vivian's got a little helper.

23
00:02:17,220 --> 00:02:18,920
Hey, Grandpa?

24
00:02:19,860 --> 00:02:21,297
This is getting weird.

25
00:02:21,380 --> 00:02:23,792
Wait, what are you doing in here, Gramps?

26
00:02:23,920 --> 00:02:25,620
Uh, I can explain.

27
00:02:33,020 --> 00:02:34,140
You Nimrod!

28
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:36,400
You had one simple job!

29
00:02:37,040 --> 00:02:38,437
Give me another chance.

30
00:02:38,520 --> 00:02:39,880
I'll get it next time.

31
00:02:40,020 --> 00:02:41,760
He works fine. Hold on.

32
00:02:41,980 --> 00:02:43,420
Did Vivian kidnap you?

33
00:02:43,740 --> 00:02:46,680
Or did you guys plan this
whole thing together?

34
00:02:47,060 --> 00:02:48,757
Oh, forget about that, old man.

35
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:51,620
Now, let's talk about you and me!

36
00:02:59,180 --> 00:03:02,540
Welcome to the real Grand
Championship Tournament, Yugi!

37
00:03:02,920 --> 00:03:05,979
Where you and I are gonna
duke it out for the crown!

38
00:03:09,100 --> 00:03:10,160
Give it up!

39
00:03:10,460 --> 00:03:14,820
You had your chance and Rebecca
cancelled you out, Viv! That's right!

40
00:03:15,020 --> 00:03:17,397
Only the winner of the
tournament gets a title shot!

41
00:03:17,480 --> 00:03:18,800
You already blew it.

42
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:20,520
Didn't you hear me?

43
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:24,757
I'm starting my own tournament, and
the first match is Yu-Gi against me.

44
00:03:24,840 --> 00:03:25,700
So let's duel.

45
00:03:26,300 --> 00:03:27,180
Pretty please?

46
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:29,020
Sorry, Viv.

47
00:03:29,200 --> 00:03:32,060
It's against Kaiba's
tournament rules. Come on.

48
00:03:32,480 --> 00:03:34,140
You're making a mistake.

49
00:03:34,500 --> 00:03:37,117
The right thing to do
is duel against Vivian.

50
00:03:37,200 --> 00:03:38,030
Huh?

51
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:42,040
Hey, that demented diva must
have hypnotized you, Gramps.

52
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:44,110
Wait.

53
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:46,220
You kids have got it all wrong.

54
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:50,080
It's quite an amusing story, actually.

55
00:03:51,740 --> 00:03:56,260
I was relaxing in my hospital
bed when Vivian came by.

56
00:03:56,860 --> 00:04:01,220
My back was slightly irritated. Mr. Moto?

57
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:07,320
I may be able to help you out
if you help me. Of course.

58
00:04:07,640 --> 00:04:09,620
I'll do anything. Awesome!

59
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:10,920
It's a deal!

60
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:22,937
my pack it's cured thank you had

61
00:04:23,020 --> 00:04:24,957
it not been for vivian i wouldn't be

62
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:30,177
standing here so i owed her a favor
that's why i led you kids here and turned

63
00:04:30,260 --> 00:04:35,377
his back on his own grandson hey i
heard that and to think i once looked

64
00:04:35,460 --> 00:04:40,280
up to you you forgot what's important
you forgot the heart of the cards.

65
00:04:40,780 --> 00:04:42,020
He's right, Gramps.

66
00:04:42,200 --> 00:04:43,200
What have I done?

67
00:04:43,540 --> 00:04:44,440
I'm sorry.

68
00:04:44,740 --> 00:04:46,337
So that's how it's going to be.

69
00:04:46,420 --> 00:04:47,250
Have it

70
00:04:53,020 --> 00:04:53,850
your way.

71
00:04:53,933 --> 00:04:54,763
Not again.

72
00:04:54,846 --> 00:04:56,397
What did you do to Yugi's grandpa?

73
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:58,715
I just returned him to the way he was.

74
00:04:59,520 --> 00:05:00,350
That's all.

75
00:05:00,433 --> 00:05:01,277
Grandpa, are you okay?

76
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:02,301
Here's the deal.

77
00:05:02,460 --> 00:05:04,917
If you want your Gramps
to walk upright again,

78
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:11,837
you're gonna have to duel me that's a
dirty trick i know and i can't believe

79
00:05:11,920 --> 00:05:16,817
i didn't think of it sooner so who's

80
00:05:16,900 --> 00:05:19,537
it gonna be yugi your grandfather or

81
00:05:19,620 --> 00:05:26,177
me don't listen to a yug we can save
your grandpa without her help but how

82
00:05:26,260 --> 00:05:33,000
he needs us what should we do we have
no choice we have to duel All right.

83
00:05:37,020 --> 00:05:38,080
Yu-Gi-Oh!

84
00:05:42,160 --> 00:05:44,101
It's time to set things straight.

85
00:05:46,200 --> 00:05:47,420
Let's do this!

86
00:05:47,660 --> 00:05:51,240
Just as I thought, I knew
you couldn't resist my charm.

87
00:05:51,680 --> 00:05:55,020
All right, if you defeat
me, then your grandpa walks.

88
00:05:55,200 --> 00:05:57,280
If you lose, we go on a date.

89
00:05:57,520 --> 00:05:58,755
All right, that's it!

90
00:05:58,880 --> 00:06:01,277
I've heard just about
enough out of you, toots.

91
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:03,040
Get it through your head!

92
00:06:03,520 --> 00:06:05,940
Yugi doesn't like you and he never will!

93
00:06:06,180 --> 00:06:07,840
All right, just breathe.

94
00:06:08,180 --> 00:06:10,827
If that's your challenge,
then I must accept.

95
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:13,400
Oh, great. No problem.

96
00:06:13,880 --> 00:06:14,840
Relax, guys.

97
00:06:15,140 --> 00:06:17,077
Yugi can duel circles around her.

98
00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:18,984
I wouldn't count on it, losers.

99
00:06:19,280 --> 00:06:23,456
Because I'm about to unleash the
devastating force of Hurricane Vivian!

100
00:06:28,380 --> 00:06:29,760
It's time to duel!

101
00:06:32,140 --> 00:06:38,220
Our last semi-final match is a close
look, folks, as Rebecca faces Leon Wilson!

102
00:06:38,980 --> 00:06:41,220
All right, kids. My move!

103
00:06:41,880 --> 00:06:45,260
I activate my Pot of Greed Magic card.

104
00:06:45,560 --> 00:06:48,089
Now I can draw two more
cards from my deck.

105
00:06:48,580 --> 00:06:50,140
Then I'll play this.

106
00:06:50,900 --> 00:06:52,820
My Witch of the Black Forest.

107
00:06:55,820 --> 00:06:59,640
Now it's time to turn your
carriage into pumpkin pie.

108
00:07:03,340 --> 00:07:06,980
I guess Cinderella's not
going to the ball after all.

109
00:07:07,300 --> 00:07:08,680
Poor little princess.

110
00:07:09,340 --> 00:07:11,380
Not exactly. Watch this.

111
00:07:12,480 --> 00:07:16,362
Cinderella, attack her witch of
the Black Forest with Shatterkick.

112
00:07:21,320 --> 00:07:23,791
And her shoes come back without a scratch.

113
00:07:25,400 --> 00:07:28,341
But at least my witch
wasn't blown up for nothing.

114
00:07:28,920 --> 00:07:32,567
When she goes to the graveyard,
her special ability activates,

115
00:07:33,020 --> 00:07:35,960
letting me transfer my
Ruby Dragon to my hand.

116
00:07:36,200 --> 00:07:37,240
No big deal.

117
00:07:37,500 --> 00:07:40,920
Now I summon Tom Thumb in defense mode.

118
00:07:41,260 --> 00:07:44,800
Then I'll place this face
down to end my turn. Oh, no.

119
00:07:45,120 --> 00:07:48,237
How will I ever fight against
a fairy princess and an elf?

120
00:07:48,320 --> 00:07:49,280
Wait, I know.

121
00:07:49,480 --> 00:07:50,740
I'll just use this.

122
00:07:51,160 --> 00:07:52,440
Ruby Dragon!

123
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:54,917
But wait.

124
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:59,540
Before I attack, I'm going to
activate my Dragonspire magic card.

125
00:08:02,580 --> 00:08:05,340
It gives my dragon a bonus power.

126
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:10,220
The ability to wipe out any monster
that has 800 defense points or less.

127
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:21,060
Blast his little garden
gnome with crimson commotion.

128
00:08:22,540 --> 00:08:24,037
I don't think so.

129
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:25,100
Watch this!

130
00:08:25,540 --> 00:08:26,740
Go negate attack!

131
00:08:28,960 --> 00:08:32,800
And just like its name says,
my card negates your attack.

132
00:08:33,200 --> 00:08:34,980
You think you're so cool.

133
00:08:35,160 --> 00:08:36,454
Well, you're not, kid.

134
00:08:36,900 --> 00:08:39,600
He counteracts my moves every turn.

135
00:08:39,860 --> 00:08:44,580
And without Yugi to cheer me on, I don't
have the confidence I need to stop him.

136
00:08:44,920 --> 00:08:46,273
You can do it, Rebecca!

137
00:08:46,580 --> 00:08:49,577
You're the best! Hawkins!
Hawkins! Hawkins!

138
00:08:49,660 --> 00:08:52,057
On second thought, I'm not alone at all.

139
00:08:52,140 --> 00:08:54,320
I've got tons of support out there.

140
00:08:54,580 --> 00:08:56,000
We're all behind you.

141
00:08:56,400 --> 00:08:57,600
Let's run, Earl.

142
00:08:58,500 --> 00:09:01,020
I'd be paying attention if I were you.

143
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:03,960
I activate Giant's Training.

144
00:09:04,380 --> 00:09:06,300
This card will be your downfall.

145
00:09:06,680 --> 00:09:10,880
It lets me sacrifice Tom
Thumb in order to summon this.

146
00:09:11,120 --> 00:09:14,280
My good buddy Globerman in attack mode.

147
00:09:14,640 --> 00:09:17,260
Now show her Ruby Dragon who's boss.

148
00:09:22,140 --> 00:09:22,970
No!

149
00:09:32,800 --> 00:09:34,220
Activate trap card!

150
00:09:34,540 --> 00:09:35,500
Rope of life!

151
00:09:35,840 --> 00:09:39,617
It kicks in as soon as one of my
monsters is sent to the graveyard.

152
00:09:39,700 --> 00:09:43,876
And once I toss out my entire hand,
it lets me bring that monster back.

153
00:09:44,040 --> 00:09:47,580
Oh, and did I mention it gets
an extra 800 attack points?

154
00:09:47,900 --> 00:09:49,860
So thanks for the power boost.

155
00:09:53,140 --> 00:09:55,500
Next I'll activate a magic card!

156
00:09:55,740 --> 00:09:58,260
It's called Adamantine Sword Revival!

157
00:09:58,480 --> 00:10:03,186
And it lets me replace the dragon I just
brought back with an even stronger one!

158
00:10:03,420 --> 00:10:05,600
My Diamond Head Dragon!

159
00:10:14,980 --> 00:10:19,557
It may start out with the same number of
attack points that my Ruby Dragon has,

160
00:10:19,640 --> 00:10:23,111
But then it gets an extra
thousand thanks to my magic card.

161
00:10:23,660 --> 00:10:27,060
3,400 attack points? Yup.

162
00:10:27,540 --> 00:10:28,700
I end my turn.

163
00:10:29,340 --> 00:10:32,222
But wait till you see what
I've got planned next.

164
00:10:37,820 --> 00:10:38,740
Excuse me.

165
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:41,100
I'm never leaving this place.

166
00:10:42,880 --> 00:10:44,980
How can you be eating now?

167
00:10:45,320 --> 00:10:46,837
Yuki needs us out there.

168
00:10:46,920 --> 00:10:50,240
He doesn't need us
yelling in his ear to win

169
00:10:51,240 --> 00:10:53,860
Now relax, and try the chicken

170
00:10:54,860 --> 00:10:56,840
What kind? Sesame!

171
00:10:58,380 --> 00:11:01,204
Hey guys, things aren't
looking so good for Yugi

172
00:11:02,100 --> 00:11:06,700
Now I sacrifice my Master
Kianchi and my Kung Fu Nian Nian

173
00:11:09,040 --> 00:11:13,797
This allows me to summon my Dragon
Lady in attack mode Not bad, huh?

174
00:11:13,880 --> 00:11:19,560
And next, I have a little something
special planned just for you. Ready?

175
00:11:20,160 --> 00:11:23,700
And now I play Lightning Saber!

176
00:11:24,100 --> 00:11:27,400
Which increases Dragon
Lady's strength by 300!

177
00:11:30,840 --> 00:11:35,120
Now, attack his Dark Magician
with Lightning Saber Swipe!

178
00:11:40,760 --> 00:11:42,640
Now, direct attack!

179
00:11:44,800 --> 00:11:46,400
How did she attack twice?

180
00:11:46,760 --> 00:11:49,177
I assume that you figured this out by now.

181
00:11:49,260 --> 00:11:50,697
But thanks to her new sword,

182
00:11:50,780 --> 00:11:55,662
all I have to do is cut my dragon lady's
strength in half and she can attack twice.

183
00:11:55,920 --> 00:11:57,520
Very well. My move.

184
00:11:59,240 --> 00:12:02,840
Now I play Big Shield
Gardener in defense mode.

185
00:12:04,420 --> 00:12:08,100
Then I'll place one card
face down and end my turn.

186
00:12:08,980 --> 00:12:11,557
Even if Yugi loses, at
least he gets a date.

187
00:12:11,640 --> 00:12:14,660
Yugi won't lose, so drop the date thing.

188
00:12:14,980 --> 00:12:16,804
Time for another double attack.

189
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:21,261
So first, I'll rid the field of
that unsightly big shield gardener.

190
00:12:23,100 --> 00:12:24,760
Reveal my trap card.

191
00:12:25,180 --> 00:12:27,200
Mirror Force, block her attack.

192
00:12:27,700 --> 00:12:29,740
Then I'll play this card.

193
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:33,760
It's a handy little number I
like to call my Snowfall Sword.

194
00:12:34,020 --> 00:12:37,020
And it cancels out the
effect of your Mirror Force.

195
00:12:48,660 --> 00:12:49,900
This isn't good.

196
00:12:50,760 --> 00:12:53,957
Yugi's got no monsters on the
field to protect his life points.

197
00:12:54,040 --> 00:12:57,920
This seems like a good time to
activate my flying dragon world.

198
00:12:58,340 --> 00:13:02,458
Now all I have to do is send four
of my dragons to the card graveyard.

199
00:13:02,820 --> 00:13:06,300
That raises my dragon lady's
attack points by 1,200.

200
00:13:11,880 --> 00:13:12,880
Uh-oh.

201
00:13:13,080 --> 00:13:13,980
He'll lose.

202
00:13:14,180 --> 00:13:17,060
Now, dragon lady, attack him directly.

203
00:13:17,760 --> 00:13:20,580
I did it. I won. I won.

204
00:13:24,440 --> 00:13:25,620
Guess again.

205
00:13:28,960 --> 00:13:29,790
What?

206
00:13:30,040 --> 00:13:35,100
All I have to do now is discard my Karibo,
and my life points remain untouched.

207
00:13:38,460 --> 00:13:41,480
How dare you ruin my victory with that?

208
00:13:41,640 --> 00:13:43,840
Just you wait until next turn.

209
00:13:44,060 --> 00:13:45,060
Just you wait!

210
00:13:45,600 --> 00:13:48,100
There is no next turn. But why?

211
00:13:48,500 --> 00:13:51,837
You're about to find out, because
I'm ending this right now.

212
00:13:51,920 --> 00:13:55,740
But that's impossible. We'll see. I draw.

213
00:13:57,040 --> 00:13:57,900
All right.

214
00:13:58,200 --> 00:14:02,435
First, I'll summon my skilled Dark
Magician to the field in attack mode.

215
00:14:04,320 --> 00:14:09,600
Second, I activate Pot of Greed, which
lets me draw two more cards from my deck.

216
00:14:11,720 --> 00:14:15,800
Then I'll play this, the
Emblem of Dragon Destroyer.

217
00:14:15,980 --> 00:14:19,340
It lets me bring Buster
Blader back to my hand.

218
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:23,100
What are those lights?

219
00:14:23,540 --> 00:14:24,893
They're spell counters.

220
00:14:25,240 --> 00:14:28,380
With every magic card I
play, another one lights up.

221
00:14:30,520 --> 00:14:32,440
I'm afraid there's more.

222
00:14:32,820 --> 00:14:34,540
My final magic card.

223
00:14:34,720 --> 00:14:37,620
It's known as Monster Reincarnation.

224
00:14:38,860 --> 00:14:41,840
So Dark Magician's back in my deck

225
00:14:43,200 --> 00:14:46,997
And now all three of my
spell counters are glowing

226
00:14:47,080 --> 00:14:51,617
So I can sacrifice my skill
Dark Magician In order

227
00:14:51,700 --> 00:14:57,397
to summon Dark Magician There's
more I play Polymerization

228
00:14:57,480 --> 00:15:01,580
Fusing my Dark Magician
with my Buster Blader

229
00:15:06,720 --> 00:15:11,760
Behold, the creature of
your demise My Dark Paladin

230
00:15:14,620 --> 00:15:18,077
And there's one more
thing you should know Dark

231
00:15:18,160 --> 00:15:21,537
Paladin gets 500 attack
points for every dragon on the

232
00:15:21,620 --> 00:15:25,857
field And in our graveyard
That can't be I just sent

233
00:15:25,940 --> 00:15:30,980
four dragons to my card
graveyard It's not fair Oh,

234
00:15:31,400 --> 00:15:32,341
it's quite fair.

235
00:15:33,360 --> 00:15:38,660
Now, Dark Paladin wipe out her
dragon lady and her life points!

236
00:15:44,940 --> 00:15:46,500
Game over.

237
00:15:48,960 --> 00:15:50,220
Hey, hey, hey.

238
00:15:50,540 --> 00:15:52,280
Way to go, Luke!

239
00:15:57,440 --> 00:16:00,960
All right, Viv, it's time
for you to pay up now.

240
00:16:01,420 --> 00:16:03,140
My grandpa's waiting.

241
00:16:04,420 --> 00:16:05,420
Thanks, Yuki.

242
00:16:11,980 --> 00:16:16,000
With only 100 life points left,
you better make this one count.

243
00:16:16,780 --> 00:16:17,610
Rebecca!

244
00:16:18,260 --> 00:16:19,500
You showed up!

245
00:16:19,600 --> 00:16:23,480
Of course we did. Hey, Beck. You
go, girl. Yeah. Thanks, guys.

246
00:16:24,200 --> 00:16:25,140
Hey, let's go.

247
00:16:25,500 --> 00:16:27,460
No sleeping on the job, Rebecca.

248
00:16:27,800 --> 00:16:30,860
Not with only 100 points left. No biggie.

249
00:16:31,040 --> 00:16:33,897
I can't lose now that my
lucky charm's finally here.

250
00:16:33,980 --> 00:16:34,810
Go get him.

251
00:16:35,800 --> 00:16:36,840
All right, kid.

252
00:16:37,120 --> 00:16:41,200
I'll start by attacking your
Globerman with my Diamond Head Dragon.

253
00:16:49,400 --> 00:16:50,337
Way to go.

254
00:16:50,420 --> 00:16:53,320
You can do this, Beck! Stay strong!

255
00:16:53,760 --> 00:16:56,500
I place one card face
down and end my turn.

256
00:16:56,900 --> 00:16:58,460
Thanks to my new card,

257
00:16:58,800 --> 00:17:00,437
when Leon summons a monster,

258
00:17:00,520 --> 00:17:02,857
the difference between
its defense points and my

259
00:17:02,940 --> 00:17:06,058
monster's attack points
comes out of his life points.

260
00:17:06,240 --> 00:17:10,520
So, as long as he plays something
with less than 2,500 defense points,

261
00:17:10,820 --> 00:17:12,680
I automatically win the duel.

262
00:17:13,180 --> 00:17:15,700
Now, let's see what you've got, shall we?

263
00:17:15,940 --> 00:17:17,900
Well, here goes my move.

264
00:17:18,420 --> 00:17:22,320
I'll start by activating my
Gold Moon Coin Magic Card.

265
00:17:22,620 --> 00:17:25,017
So that means the first thing I have to do

266
00:17:25,100 --> 00:17:27,629
is hand over every card
I'm holding to you.

267
00:17:27,720 --> 00:17:30,397
Then I get to replace
the cards I just gave up

268
00:17:30,480 --> 00:17:33,362
by drawing the same number
of cards from my deck.

269
00:17:35,200 --> 00:17:36,740
Spinning Wheel Spindle?

270
00:17:36,980 --> 00:17:38,940
But that doesn't make any sense.

271
00:17:39,100 --> 00:17:41,797
You could have destroyed
my monster with this.

272
00:17:41,880 --> 00:17:42,977
Well, that's true.

273
00:17:43,060 --> 00:17:47,137
But it wouldn't have wiped out your life
point, so it was still too risky a move.

274
00:17:47,220 --> 00:17:48,940
But I have a better idea.

275
00:17:49,360 --> 00:17:52,680
One that lets me win the
duel right away. Yeah, right.

276
00:17:53,160 --> 00:17:54,060
But how?

277
00:17:54,460 --> 00:17:58,740
I don't know, but something tells
me Leon isn't bluffing, Yuki.

278
00:17:59,420 --> 00:18:01,360
Now, on to phase two.

279
00:18:01,620 --> 00:18:07,100
I activate this, my 100-Year
Awakening Magic card. What's that?

280
00:18:10,520 --> 00:18:13,980
It lets me sacrifice my
Curse of Thorns card.

281
00:18:14,580 --> 00:18:15,700
Wait a sec.

282
00:18:16,380 --> 00:18:18,500
Now I can summon Thorn Princess!

283
00:18:21,460 --> 00:18:23,519
What's the point of all this, Leon?

284
00:18:24,900 --> 00:18:27,680
I activate her special ability!

285
00:18:28,020 --> 00:18:31,608
Letting me control one of your
monsters as if it were my own!

286
00:18:32,020 --> 00:18:33,000
No way!

287
00:18:33,360 --> 00:18:34,580
I'm afraid so!

288
00:18:34,920 --> 00:18:37,280
Now your Diamond Head Dragon is mine!

289
00:18:39,160 --> 00:18:41,780
Now attack her life points directly!

290
00:18:52,440 --> 00:18:55,300
We've completed our investigation of Mr.

291
00:18:55,420 --> 00:18:58,714
Siegfried Lloyd, and your
assumptions were correct, sir.

292
00:18:59,400 --> 00:19:02,280
Siegfried, your little game's over.

293
00:19:04,000 --> 00:19:05,377
Don't sweat it, Rebecca.

294
00:19:05,460 --> 00:19:06,540
Come on.

295
00:19:06,720 --> 00:19:07,977
You played a great duel.

296
00:19:08,060 --> 00:19:09,880
I don't need your pity.

297
00:19:10,500 --> 00:19:11,760
But thank you.

298
00:19:12,240 --> 00:19:13,937
Now don't let it go to your head.

299
00:19:14,020 --> 00:19:16,420
There's a long way to go. That's true.

300
00:19:16,700 --> 00:19:17,580
Good game.

301
00:19:17,980 --> 00:19:20,797
Yeah, that wasn't half
bad for a couple of kids.

302
00:19:20,880 --> 00:19:22,500
Kids that can out-duel you.

303
00:19:27,380 --> 00:19:30,280
Seriously, you did great. Thanks, Yugi.

304
00:19:33,600 --> 00:19:36,957
I wanted to win so badly, it's not fair!

305
00:19:37,040 --> 00:19:39,620
I just wanted another chance.

306
00:19:40,020 --> 00:19:40,902
You'll get one?

307
00:19:41,080 --> 00:19:43,420
Must she be so dramatic?

308
00:19:44,080 --> 00:19:45,720
Fuck who's talking! No!

309
00:19:46,380 --> 00:19:47,260
Who, me?

310
00:19:47,560 --> 00:19:49,031
Does this sound familiar?

311
00:19:49,200 --> 00:19:50,260
My back hurts.

312
00:19:50,480 --> 00:19:51,421
Someone help me.

313
00:19:51,600 --> 00:19:54,160
I'd like to see you do it in 50 years.
